---
description: Installs NativeWind 4.2.7 with Tailwind CSS v3 for Expo.
globs: package.json
---
- NativeWind 4.2.7 is the stable release and uses Tailwind CSS v3:
  - `npm install nativewind@4.2.7 react-native-reanimated react-native-safe-area-context`
  - `npm install --save-dev tailwindcss@^3.4.17 prettier-plugin-tailwindcss@^0.5.11 babel-preset-expo`
- On Expo 57 with Reanimated 4, install native packages with `npx expo install react-native-reanimated react-native-worklets react-native-safe-area-context`. Projects on Reanimated 3 keep their existing compatible native packages.
- `tailwind.config.js` sets `presets: [require("nativewind/preset")]` and `content` paths for files that use NativeWind classes.
- `global.css` contains `@tailwind base;`, `@tailwind components;`, and `@tailwind utilities;`, and is passed to `withNativeWind`.